{"schema_version":1,"pipeline_version":"v6","run_id":"data-analysis-2026-02-04-20260204033100.-c3dd67f5","generated_at":"2026-02-04T03:31:00.641Z","canonical_id":"huggingface:laion/CLIP-ViT-B-32-laion2B-s34B-b79K","promptHash":"sha256:9f8bdea849c6032b5a9370006a56658ea7906f2bf14c98bf7a25334339cfb93a","summary_version":1,"status":"qualified","source":"huggingface","name":"CLIP-ViT-B-32-laion2B-s34B-b79K","url":"https://huggingface.co/laion/CLIP-ViT-B-32-laion2B-s34B-b79K","tags":["open_clip","pytorch","safetensors","clip","zero-shot-image-classification","arxiv:1910.04867","license:mit","region:us"],"stats":{"downloads_total":1782355,"likes_total":136},"metadata":{"license":"N/A","lang":"N/A","categories":{"capabilities":[],"scenes":[],"lifecycle":[]}},"summary_short":{"zh":"CLIP-ViT-B-32-laion2B-s34B-b79K 是一个基于大规模网络数据训练的视觉-语言模型，它通过对比学习将图像和文本映射到同一语义空间，实现了无需特定任务训练的零样本图像分类。其核心在于使用ViT-B/32架构处理图像，结合文本编码器，通过海量图像-文本对进行联合训练，使模型能理解跨模态的语义关联。实践中，开发者可通过Hugging Face库快速调用，用于智能图库检索、内容安全过滤或创意生成，只需输入自然语言描述即可匹配相关图像，为多模态应用提供灵活基础。","en":"CLIP-ViT-B-32-laion2B-s34B-b79K is a vision-language model that bridges images and text by learning from massive web-scale datasets, enabling zero-shot image classification without task-specific training. Its key innovation lies in contrastive learning, which aligns visual and t…","es":"CLIP-ViT-B-32-laion2B-s34B-b79K is a vision-language model that bridges images and text by learning from massive web-scale datasets, enabling zero-shot image classification without task-specific training. Its key innovation lies in contrastive learning, which aligns visual and t…"},"summaries":{"en":"CLIP-ViT-B-32-laion2B-s34B-b79K is a vision-language model that bridges images and text by learning from massive web-scale datasets, enabling zero-shot image classification without task-specific training. Its key innovation lies in contrastive learning, which aligns visual and textual representations in a shared embedding space through simultaneous training on image-text pairs. Developers can use it via Hugging Face's Transformers library for tasks like image search, content moderation, or creative applications by simply providing natural language queries to match with images.","zh":"CLIP-ViT-B-32-laion2B-s34B-b79K 是一个基于大规模网络数据训练的视觉-语言模型，它通过对比学习将图像和文本映射到同一语义空间，实现了无需特定任务训练的零样本图像分类。其核心在于使用ViT-B/32架构处理图像，结合文本编码器，通过海量图像-文本对进行联合训练，使模型能理解跨模态的语义关联。实践中，开发者可通过Hugging Face库快速调用，用于智能图库检索、内容安全过滤或创意生成，只需输入自然语言描述即可匹配相关图像，为多模态应用提供灵活基础。","es":"CLIP-ViT-B-32-laion2B-s34B-b79K is a vision-language model that bridges images and text by learning from massive web-scale datasets, enabling zero-shot image classification without task-specific training. Its key innovation lies in contrastive learning, which aligns visual and textual representations in a shared embedding space through simultaneous training on image-text pairs. Developers can use it via Hugging Face's Transformers library for tasks like image search, content moderation, or creative applications by simply providing natural language queries to match with images."},"provider":{"name":"deepseek-tri","version":"1.0.0","mode":"json_single"},"quality":{"score":0.92,"fallback":false,"length":{"en":583,"zh":241,"es":583},"warnings":["es_short:0"],"accepted_at":"2026-02-04T03:27:34.223Z"}}
